@startuml CareerBridge_Sequence_Recommend
title CareerBridge - Sequence: Recommended for me (Member 4 feature)
skinparam shadowing false
actor Student
participant CareerBridgeApp as UI
participant Member4MatchService as Svc
participant Store
participant Member3Security as Sec

Student -> UI : press "Recommended for me"
UI -> Svc : recommend(store, current, today, 5)
Svc -> Sec : isApplicant(current)
Sec --> Svc : true
loop each opportunity in store
  Svc -> Store : application(email, id)
  note right of Svc : skip if closed, expired or already applied
  Svc -> Svc : evaluate(applicant, opportunity)
end
Svc -> Svc : sort by skillScore, fieldMatches, deadline
Svc --> UI : List<Match>
UI --> Student : dialog with ranked matches
@enduml
